{
    "pageid": 2953,
    "title": "Friendship",
    "sections": [
        {
            "heading": "Introduction",
            "level": 1,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Friendship is a symmetric relationship between two characters. It has a significant opinion boost and several other effects."
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Making friends",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "There are many random events that add friends, but the ones most under player control are:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "With Way of Life and focuses :",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Carousing focus: high chance to befriend one guest at each party",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Business focus: can establish a friendship with your trading partner (an infidel ruler) if opinion is high at the end of the event chain",
                                    "children": []
                                },
                                {
                                    "text": "Family focus: can establish a friendship with a sibling, between two minor children, or between two dynastic close relatives (once mutual opinion reaches 50+)",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "With Horse Lords :",
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "text": "Hire HL dynamic mercenaries. Many of them are cheap to hire, and some are future khans or khagans !",
                                    "children": []
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Effects of friendship",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "You may have an opportunity to convert to a friend's religion , or ask them to convert to yours.",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Friends can randomly offer to join each other's wars, even if not allied",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Friends on your council are more likely to be Loyalist in their voting",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "heading": "Skill boosts",
            "level": 3,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "You occasionally get a chance to ask a friend to improve a skill , if:"
                },
                {
                    "type": "list",
                    "list_type": "ul",
                    "items": [
                        {
                            "text": "Neither of you is at war or leading troops",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Your skill level is between 5 and 9 (inclusive)",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Friend's skill level is 11+",
                            "children": []
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Friend is not a prisoner",
                            "children": []
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "There is a five-year cooldown for each attribute."
                },
                {
                    "type": "table",
                    "rows": [
                        [
